      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "TRUNKEY MICK (2) was an on speed winner in quick time two back then gave a start but got home into the frame when third at this track (30.17) last time. Sure to be about the mark. DIESEL DASH (4) produced an impressive win last time in quickest of the meeting when scoring by a neck (19.07) at Bulli. This tougher but expected to be in the finish. COIN KEEPING (6) has good early dash but last time was shuffled out the back and missed the frame, finishing fourth (30.49) in a Grade 5 at this track. Prior to that was quickly into stride and scored (30.49) at this track. Can measure up this time. ZIPPING MILANO (7) can return to form after missing the top-three at this circuit last time out.",
